OL,3,GNEWSATwo children's homes to be set up
OL,4,Aon hospital site
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo properties purchased as part of a
OL,7,Fhospital project will be turned into
OL,8,Fchildren's homes, a minister has said.
OL,10,FThe Government of Jersey bought 12
OL,11,Fhomes in the St Helier area five years
OL,12,Fago as part of its hospital
OL,13,Fredevelopment project.
OL,15,FOfficials had planned on demolishing
OL,16,Fthe buildings, but after planning
OL,17,Frevisions the site was scaled down,
OL,18,Fmeaning there was no longer a need to
OL,19,Fremove them.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
