OL,3,GNEWSATwo children's homes to be set up
OL,4,Aon hospital site
OL,5,
OL,6,FMinister for Infrastructure Jonathan
OL,7,FRenouf said Westmount House and
OL,8,FBerkeley Rise would become children's
OL,9,Fhomes when the hospital is finished.
